---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="relative z-10 mx-auto mt-24 w-full max-w-5xl px-5 pb-32 sm:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-rule pt-6 text-sm text-ink-soft sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <p class="font-serif italic">Grown slowly, somewhere between a desk and a forest.</p>
    <p class="eyebrow">
      &copy; {year} &middot; the sky here follows <span class="text-accent">your</span> local time
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
